    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.poster.avif?t=1737089639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.webm?t=1737089639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.mp4?t=1737089639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Interlopers is a solo-developed FPS inspired by retro classics. Wield big guns, shoot hordes of enemy robots, explore hand-crafted levels set on multiple alien worlds \u2013 and just have fun!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wield a large arsenal of weapons inspired by old-school classics \u2013 with a couple unique surprises!<br></li><li>Fight a wide array of unique mechanical beings<br></li><li>Visit multiple alien worlds that have already been conquered by the robot legion. Explore stone temples and ruins of the prior civilizations that inhabited these worlds.<br></li><li>Scour each hand-crafted level for secrets<br></li><li>Built on Unreal Engine 4 to provide a modern visual presentation with a retro gameplay experience</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Earth has fallen. In a blind jump, you've been transported off-world only to discover that other planets have suffered the same fate. A robotic legion has conquered the known universe, and you must journey across alien worlds to find a way to stop them.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.poster.avif?t=1737089639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.webm?t=1737089639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408290/extras/e2e0cb64b6fb3f194c8058e8654b0ee4.mp4?t=1737089639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Interlopers is a solo-developed FPS inspired by retro classics. Wield big guns, shoot hordes of enemy robots, explore hand-crafted levels set on multiple alien worlds \u2013 and just have fun!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Wield a large arsenal of weapons inspired by old-school classics \u2013 with a couple unique surprises!<br></li><li>Fight a wide array of unique mechanical beings<br></li><li>Visit multiple alien worlds that have already been conquered by the robot legion. Explore stone temples and ruins of the prior civilizations that inhabited these worlds.<br></li><li>Scour each hand-crafted level for secrets<br></li><li>Built on Unreal Engine 4 to provide a modern visual presentation with a retro gameplay experience</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Earth has fallen. In a blind jump, you've been transported off-world only to discover that other planets have suffered the same fate. A robotic legion has conquered the known universe, and you must journey across alien worlds to find a way to stop them.",
